    title: 'The Universal Lamp Absurdity',
    sanskrit: { text: '', transliteration: '', translation: 'If darkness is dispelled even though it does not encounter lamplight, this [lamplight] dwelling here would eliminate the darkness that dwells in all the worlds.' },
